{"id":"P064-2","subject":"P","unit":"P064","unitTitle":"2024 하반기 · 24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P064-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n단상 전력계 두 개를 다음과 같이 회로에 접속하여 전력을\n\n측정하니 두 단상 전력계 모두 200W를 지시하였다. 이\n\n경우에 3상 부하의 역률은 몇 인가?\n\n\n\n\n\n① 80          ② 85\n\n③ 90          ④ 95\n\n⑤ 100","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m26-q.webp","width":678,"height":818},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m26-e1.webp","width":678,"height":712}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n다음에 주어진 계전기에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 과전류 계전기  : 회로에 흐르는 전류가 일정값 이상이\n\n  되었을 때 동작한다.\n\n② 과전압 계전기 : 회로에 인가되는 전압이 일정값 이상이\n\n  되었을 때 동작한다.\n\n③ 비율차동계전기  : 발전기, 변압기의 내부고장을 보호\n\n  하기 위해 사용된다.\n\n④ 선택지락계전기 : 고장발생으로 과전류가 흐를 때 동작\n\n  한다.\n\n⑤ 방향단락계전기  : 일정한 방향으로 일정값 이상의\n\n  단락전류가 흐르는 경우에 동작한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m27-q.webp","width":678,"height":565},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":456}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n동기조상기에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?\n\n\n① 동기전동기의 V특성을 이용하는 설비이다.\n\n② 송전계통의 전압을 일정하게 유지하기 위한 설비이다.\n\n③ 과여자로 하여 리액터로 사용한다.\n\n④ 리액터로 사용시 지상 무효전력을 공급한다.\n\n⑤ 콘덴서로 사용시 진상 무효전력을 공급한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m28-q.webp","width":696,"height":603},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m28-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1289}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n분포정수로 표현된 선로에서 무왜형 조건이 성립하고 있다.\n\n단위길이당 저항이 Ωkm, 누설 컨덕턴스가\nkm, 인덕턴스가 mHkm일 때, 정전\n용량은 몇 Fkm이어야 하는가?\n\n\n①           ② \n\n③           ④ \n\n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m29-q.webp","width":696,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":593}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S2-Q05","number":5,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 30번","searchText":" 30\n\n단상 회로에 sin°V의 전압이 인가될 때,\n\nsin°A의 전류가 흐른다. 이 회로의 무효전력\n\n은 몇 VA인가?\n\n①          ② \n\n③           ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m30","number":30},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m30-q.webp","width":696,"height":597},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m30-e1.webp","width":678,"height":374}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S2-Q06","number":6,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 31번","searchText":" 31\n\n단상 부하에 인가되는 전압이 ∠°V일 때,\n\n∠°A의 전류가 흘렀다. 단상 부하의 임피던스는\n\n몇 Ω인가?\n\n①         ② \n③        ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m31","number":31},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m31-q.webp","width":678,"height":572},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m31-e1.webp","width":678,"height":426}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S2-Q07","number":7,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 32번","searchText":" 32\n\n송전계통의 안정도를 향상시키기 위한 대책으로 옳지 않은\n\n것은?\n\n\n① 속응여자 방식을 채용한다.\n\n② 조속기의 동작을 느리게 한다.\n\n③ 적당한 중성점 접지방식을 채용하여 지락전류의 크기를\n\n  조절한다.\n\n④ 고장 발생과 동시에 발전기 회로의 저항을 직렬 또는\n\n  병렬로 삽입하여 전류의 불평형을 줄인다.\n\n⑤ 고속도 재폐로 방식을 채용한다.","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m32","number":32},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m32-q.webp","width":678,"height":723},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m32-e1.webp","width":678,"height":820}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S2-Q08","number":8,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 33번","searchText":" 33\n\n연간 전력량이 109500kWh이고, 연간 최대전력이 20\nkW일 때, 연부하율은 몇 인가?\n\n\n① 62.5         ② 65\n\n③ 72.5         ④ 75\n\n⑤ 78.5","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m33","number":33},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m33-q.webp","width":678,"height":588},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m33-e1.webp","width":678,"height":264},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m33-e2.webp","width":696,"height":1485}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S2-Q09","number":9,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 34번","searchText":" 34\n\n수차 발전기에서 사용유량이 100ms이고, 발생전력이\n\n98000kW일 때, 유효낙차는 몇 m인가?\n\n\n\n\n① 95          ② 98\n\n③ 100         ④ 105\n\n⑤ 110","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m34","number":34},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m34-q.webp","width":696,"height":567},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m34-e1.webp","width":696,"height":399}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S2-Q10","number":10,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 35번","searchText":" 35\n\n화력발전기에서 사이클 효율 50, 보일러효율 86,\n\n발전기 효율 90이고, 사용하는 석탄의 발열량이\n\n5000kcalkg이다. 이 발전기를 부하율 90로 1일간\n연속운전할 때 필요한 석탄량이 24t일 때, 발생 전력은\n\n몇 kW인가? (단, kWhkcal이다.)\n\n\n① 2025         ② 2250\n\n③ 2500         ④ 4250\n\n⑤ 4500","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m35","number":35},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m35-q.webp","width":696,"height":723},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m35-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1044}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S2-Q11","number":11,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 36번","searchText":" 36\n\n자성체의 길이가 m, 단면적이 m, 자기저항이\n× AT일 때, 자성체의 비투자율은?\n\n\n① 10          ② 20\n\n③ 25          ④ 40\n\n⑤ 50","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m36","number":36},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m36-q.webp","width":696,"height":593},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m36-e1.webp","width":678,"height":496}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S2-Q12","number":12,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 37번","searchText":" 37\n\n길이가 20cm, 단면적이 3m인 막대철심에 감긴 권수\n가 500이고, 자속이 × , 자기저항이 × \nAT일 때, 권선에 흐르는 전류는 몇 A 인가?\n\n\n\n\n① 5           ② 10\n\n③ 15          ④ 20\n\n⑤ 25","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m37","number":37},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m37-q.webp","width":678,"height":651},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m37-e1.webp","width":678,"height":343}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S2-Q13","number":13,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 38번","searchText":" 38\n\n어떤 코일에 흐르는 전류가 1초동안 20A에서 70A 로\n\n변할 때, 1V의 기전력이 유도 되었다. 이 코일의 자기\n\n인덕턴스는 몇 mH 인가.\n\n\n① 0.2          ② 0.5\n\n③ 1           ④ 10\n\n⑤ 20","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m38","number":38},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m38-q.webp","width":678,"height":683},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m38-e1.webp","width":696,"height":354}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":true,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S2-Q14","number":14,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 39번","searchText":" 39\n\n무한 선도체에 균일한 선전하 Cm가 분포되어 있을\n\n때, 선도체로부터 0.5m 떨어진 점의 전계가 18Vm였\n\n다면, 1.5m 떨어진 점의 전계는 몇 Vm인가?\n\n\n① 6           ② 9\n\n③ 18          ④ 36\n\n⑤ 54","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m39","number":39},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m39-q.webp","width":678,"height":549},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m39-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1528}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P064-S2-Q15","number":15,"question":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노) · 객관식 40번","searchText":" 40\n\n최대 전계가 37.7Vm일 때, 비유전율이 144,\n비투자율이 인 경우, 자계의 최댓값은 몇 ATm\n\n인가?\n\n\n① 0.8          ② 1.2\n\n③ 1.6          ④ 2.4\n\n⑤ 3.6","source":{"collection":"2024h2","collectionLabel":"2024 하반기","examLabel":"24.11.16 한전 KPS (G3) (휴노)","originalId":"2024h2-e23-m40","number":40},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m40-q.webp","width":696,"height":612},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2024h2-e23-m40-e1.webp","width":678,"height":1229}],"responseType":"